Here is the complete guide to separating the messy inline sx styles and the local constant objects from your JournalBulkUpload component into your styling file.
This will clean up the top of your component and make everything completely modular.
### Step 1: Add jbuStyles to JournalStyle.js
Open your JournalStyle.js file and **append** this new object at the bottom. I have merged all your local constants and inline styles into this single export named jbuStyles (Journal Bulk Upload Styles).
```javascript
// Add this to the bottom of JournalStyle.js

export const jbuStyles = {
  // 1. Loading & EOD Screen
  loadingBox: { display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', height: '80vh' },
  eodBox: { display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'top', height: '25vh', p: 3 },
  eodPaper: { p: 6, textAlign: 'center', borderRadius: 4 },
  eodSubtitle: { mt: 2 },
  eodText: { mt: 1 },

  // 2. Selected Voucher Details Card
  svPaper: { p: 3, mb: 4, borderRadius: 1, border: "1px solid", borderColor: "divider" },
  svHeaderBox: { display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: "1px solid", borderColor: "divider", pb: 1, mb: 2 },
  svGridItem: { mb: 2 },
  svDescription: { whiteSpace: "pre-wrap", lineHeight: 1.6, fontWeight: 300 },

  // 3. Main Control Panel
  controlPanel: { padding: "30px", marginBottom: "20px", borderRadius: "12px", backgroundColor: "background.paper", boxShadow: 2 },
  dynamicWrapper: (isError, isProcessing) => ({
    borderColor: isError ? "error.main" : "primary.main",
    opacity: isProcessing ? 0.6 : 1,
  }),

  // 4. Drag & Drop Upload Box
  uploadBox: (isDragging, isError) => ({
    position: "relative", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center",
    border: 2, borderStyle: "dashed", borderRadius: "12px", padding: "60px 40px 40px 40px", cursor: "default",
    minHeight: "250px", transition: "all 0.3s ease",
    borderColor: isDragging ? "secondary.main" : (isError ? "error.main" : "primary.main"),
    backgroundColor: (theme) => isDragging ? alpha(theme.palette.primary.main, 0.12) : alpha(theme.palette.primary.main, 0.02),
    transform: isDragging ? "scale(1.01)" : "scale(1)",
    "&:hover": { backgroundColor: (theme) => alpha(theme.palette.primary.main, 0.08), borderColor: "primary.dark" }
  }),
  
  // 5. Upload Box Inner Elements
  templateSection: { position: "absolute", top: 15, right: 20, textAlign: "right", zIndex: 10 },
  templateCaption: { display: "block", color: "text.secondary", fontWeight: 500, mb: 0.5 },
  templateBtn: { borderRadius: "8px", textTransform: "none" },
  boxCenter: { display: "flex", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", flexDirection: "column", width: "100%" },
  uploadInnerBox: { position: "relative", textAlign: "center" },
  uploadIcon: { fontSize: "6rem", color: "primary.main", mb: 1 },
  headerText: { fontWeight: 600, fontSize: "1.2rem", textAlign: "center", color: "text.primary", mb: 1 },
  subText: { color: "text.secondary", fontSize: "0.85rem", textAlign: "center", marginBottom: "25px" },
  clearFileBtn: { position: "absolute", top: -10, right: -40, bgcolor: "background.paper", "&:hover": { bgcolor: "error.light", color: "white" } },

  // 6. Action Buttons
  browseBtnWrapper: { display: "flex", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", width: "100%", flexDirection: "row", mt: 2 },
  customBtn: { background: (theme) => alpha(theme.palette.primary.main, 0.8), boxShadow: "none", color: (theme) => theme.palette.primary.contrastText || "#fff", padding: "8px 40px", "&:hover": { background: (theme) => alpha(theme.palette.primary.main, 1) } },

  // 7. Validation Stepper & Alerts
  stepperBox: { mt: 4, mb: 2 },
  errorAlert: { mt: 3, mx: "auto", maxWidth: "100%", backgroundColor: "#fff5f5", alignItems: "center" },
  successAlert: { mt: 3, mx: "auto", maxWidth: "100%", backgroundColor: "transparent", '& .MuiAlert-message': { width: '100%' } },

  // 8. Bottom Navigation
  bottomGrid: { mt: 1, mb: 1 },
  bottomBtnBox: { display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center' },
  restartBtn: { ml: 1, border: '1px solid', borderColor: 'primary.main', bgcolor: (theme) => alpha(theme.palette.primary.main, 0.05), '&:hover': { bgcolor: (theme) => alpha(theme.palette.primary.main, 0.15) } },
};

```
### Step 2: Clean up JournalBulkUpload.jsx
 1. **Delete ALL the local constants** at the top of your file (Lines 37 to 110). Delete mainContainerStyle, controlPanelStyle, uploadBoxStyle, templateSectionStyle, iconStyle, headerTextStyle, subTextStyle, descriptionIconStyle, tableContainerStyle, tableHeaderStyle, tableHeaderCellStyle, actionButtonsContainer, customButtonStyle, boxCenterStyle, and dateinputfield.
 2. Import the new styles at the top:
   ```javascript
   import { jbuStyles } from "./JournalStyle";
   
   ```
